Aim:
To develop a ReNewMarket website for buying and selling second-hand products.

Algorithm:

Create the webpage structure using HTML.
Apply CSS to design the website layout.
Use JavaScript to display available products.
Allow users to search and filter products by category and price.
Display product images, details, and prices.
Provide an option to add products for sale.
Allow users to view product details and contact sellers.
Display products based on the user's search criteria.

Result:
The ReNewMarket website was developed successfully to browse, search, and sell second-hand products.
